Upstream: https://github.com/stack-of-tasks/pinocchio

This product redistributes the following Pinocchio artifacts:
  - libpinocchio_default.so (and SONAME variants)
  - libpinocchio_collision.so (and SONAME variants)
  - libpinocchio_parsers.so (and SONAME variants)
  - Header files under src/onero_driver/include/third_party/pinocchio/

